#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:27
msgid ""
"A free, fast community theme for BuddyPress, BuddyBoss and PeepSo with a "
"modern layout and dark mode."
msgstr ""
"Um tema de comunidade gratuito e rápido para BuddyPress, BuddyBoss e PeepSo "
"com layout moderno e modo escuro."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:34
msgid ""
"The full community stack: activity feeds, member spaces, profiles, and "
"private messaging on WordPress."
msgstr ""
"O stack de comunidade completo: feeds de atividade, espaços de membros, "
"perfis e mensagens privadas no WordPress."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:41
msgid ""
"Self-moderating forums and Q&A boards that stay fast well beyond 100,000 "
"topics."
msgstr ""
"Fóruns auto-moderados e quadros de perguntas e respostas que mantêm a "
"velocidade bem além de 100.000 tópicos."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:48
msgid "A photo and video hub with albums, reactions, following, and private chat."
msgstr "Um hub de fotos e vídeos com álbuns, reações, seguimento e chat privado."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:55
msgid "Run community events with RSVPs, calendars, and front-end submissions."
msgstr "Execute eventos da comunidade com RSVPs, calendários e envios de front-end."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:62
msgid ""
"Reward members with points, badges, and leaderboards to keep engagement "
"high."
msgstr ""
"Recompense membros com pontos, emblemas e placar para manter o engajamento "
"alto."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:69
msgid ""
"Searchable directories with ten listing types, ratings, maps, and front-end "
"submissions."
msgstr ""
"Diretórios pesquisáveis com dez tipos de listagem, classificações, mapas e "
"envios de front-end."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:76
msgid ""
"Add a job board with front-end listings, applications, and employer "
"profiles."
msgstr ""
"Adicione um quadro de empregos com listagens de front-end, aplicações e "
"perfis de empregadores."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:83
msgid ""
"Create, sell, and auto-grade online courses, then hand out certificates "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Crie, venda e avalie automaticamente cursos online, depois distribua "
"certificados automaticamente."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:90
msgid ""
"A free service marketplace with vendor dashboards, an 11-status order flow, "
